  "id": "group-decision-support-systems",
  "term": "group decision support systems",
  "definition": "Group decision support systems are tools or methods designed to help teams, especially people from different disciplines, make decisions together more effectively. In this context, they are intended to support attention to information, knowledge integration, and group cognitive performance so decision quality, acceptability, and efficiency can improve.",
